This project enables the Astro stack (`tikal.yaml` → `project.types`).
Astro always loads the TypeScript stack as well.

Follow @ai-coding-tools/stacks/astro/index.md. Use the review checklist in
@ai-coding-tools/stacks/astro/review.md when analyzing or changing pages,
layouts, or content collections. Run `astro check` and `astro build` after
edits.
